'''Fading Flesh''' is an AoE spell that applies a Physical DoT debuff and is cast in pulses by Pain Totems during a Sanguine [[Ritual]] Altar encounter.

As this debuff is not a [[bleed]], a flask equipped with the Staunching mod will not remove the debuff.
